## Error Handling

### Zod Error Format

```typescript
try {
    const validated = schema.parse(data);
} catch (error) {
    if (error instanceof z.ZodError) {
        console.log(error.errors);
        // [
        //   {
        //     code: 'invalid_type',
        //     expected: 'string',
        //     received: 'number',
        //     path: ['email'],
        //     message: 'Expected string, received number'
        //   }
        // ]
    }
}
